good at doing interface

00:46:04.680 --> 00:46:09.180
and like helping convey
ideas on the graphical level.

00:46:09.180 --> 00:46:11.790
So like, I think that's
really a brilliant move

00:46:11.790 --> 00:46:13.710
on all of this interface.
- Definitely.

00:46:13.710 --> 00:46:15.900
- You also talked about the fact that

00:46:15.900 --> 00:46:20.520
you are using a software technique

00:46:20.520 --> 00:46:22.200
that people are used to,

00:46:22.200 --> 00:46:23.610
for example, like the
same way that we have

00:46:23.610 --> 00:46:26.850
still the little Save
icon being a floppy disk

00:46:26.850 --> 00:46:27.900
in the corner of your screen

00:46:27.900 --> 00:46:29.850
