to have something that is robust, complex,

00:49:48.330 --> 00:49:50.130
but still making it available for people

00:49:50.130 --> 00:49:51.000
who don't know anything.

00:49:51.000 --> 00:49:53.790
Like, if they want to,
you've been writing 2023,

